{"ref":"BDB, מַחְמַד","hw":"מַחְמַד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְמַד</span></big>  <strong>n.m. desire, desirable thing</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְמַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:6\" href=\"/Hosea.9.6\">Ho 9:6</a>; cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.6\">1 K 20:6</a> + 3 times Ez; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדַּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.16\">Ct 5:16</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:4\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.4\">La 2:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:16\" href=\"/Hosea.9.16\">Ho 9:16</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדַּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:5\" href=\"/Joel.4.5\">Jo 4:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדֵּינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.10\">Is 64:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדֶּיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.19\">2 Ch 36:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.10\">La 1:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדֵּיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.11\">La 1:11</a> Qr (v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַחְמֹד\" href=\"/BDB,_מַחְמֹד\", dir=\"rtl\">מַחְמֹד</a>);—<em>desirable, precious things</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כלי־מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.19\">2 Ch 36:19</a>; sg. coll. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:6\" href=\"/Hosea.9.6\">Ho 9:6</a>; pl. <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:5\" href=\"/Joel.4.5\">Jo 4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.10\">Is 64:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.10\">La 1:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.11\">11</a>; (Qr), <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ בִּטְנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:16\" href=\"/Hosea.9.16\">Ho 9:16</a>; v. especially pl. intens. <span dir=\"rtl\">כֻּלּוֹ מַחֲמַדִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.16\">Ct 5:16</a> <em>all of him is delightfulness</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְתַֿקִּים</span>); elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְמַד עינים</span> <em>desire of the eyes</em>, i.e. that in which the eyes take delight <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.6\">1 K 20:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.16\">Ez 24:16</a>; (of proph.’s wife), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.25\">25</a>; pl. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:4\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.4\">La 2:4</a>.","next":"BDB, מַחְמֹד","prev":"BDB, חֶמְדָּן"}